                <pb facs="0220" n="160" xml:id="pg160"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-15"><hi rendition="#italic">October 15,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Seventeen criminals will be executed Kutien; Yamên agrees all leaders to be
                    executed; all participants sentenced; all implicated to be tried. Commission
                    will probably be adjourned. Imperial decree issued referring subordinate
                    Szechuan officials to board for punishment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
